# Historical persistence implementation (retired)

SPS §8 assigns workflow-state persistence and recovery to Daemon StateManager/WAL. This old implementation is outside the current production API and build.

The unmodified document, implementation and tests are retained in [the raw baseline archive](../../../docs/archive/2026-11-07-verification-production/workflow-persistence-baseline/original/packages/workflow-runtime/docs/storage-implementation.md). They describe historical contracts, not current acceptance.
